*** Information of Subbasin / 분할유역 정보
  1 i                 [-](i)     ID
  2 i_bas_seq(i)      [-](i)     ID in calculation order
  3 bas_code(i)       [-](a)     code
  4 bas_name(i)       [-](a)     name
  5 bas_next(i)       [-](a)     code of next down
  6 bas_type(i)       [-](a)     type {s: stage, f: facility, n: node}
  7 bas_only(i)       [-](i)     whether subbasin only {1: only subbasin, 0: both subbasin and channel}
  8 bas_stage_code(i) [-](a)     code of stage station or facility
  9 bas_stage_name(i) [-](a)     name of stage station or facility
 10 bas_area(i)       [km^2](f)  area
 11 bas_length(i)     [km](f)    length of main stream
 12 bas_slope(i)      [-](f)     slope of overland
 13 L_bas_rain(i)     [-](i)     option for use of Thiessen method to get areal mean rainfall {0: not applied, otherwise: applied}
 14 L_eff_rain(i)     [-](i)     method of effective rainfall calculation {Rsa: 11, CN: 12, G-A: 13, fMax: 14, SacSMA = 21}
 15 alpha_R(i)        [-](f)     enlargement coefficient of areal mean rainfall {1.0-1.3} !$ runoff volume ↑
 16 AMC(i)            [-](f)     AMC defined by user {1.0 - 4.0: set AMC by the given value, -1: use AMC by determined by 5-day antecedent rainfall, 0: using defined Rsa or CN} !$ peak discharge ↑
 17 L_bas_runoff(i)   [-](i)     method of basin runoff calculation {SFM-1: 31, SFM-2: 32, UH-Nash: 41, UH-NRCS: 42, UH-Clark: 43, UH-unit: 44, UH-user: 49}

